WEBVTT

11:32.927 --> 11:35.930
- I already have one.
- Good man.

11:36.055 --> 11:38.724
- Have you swung it yet?
- Of course I have.

11:38.849 --> 11:40.351
At someone, I mean.

11:45.022 --> 11:48.484
It's a strange thing,
the first time you cut a man.

11:48.609 --> 11:51.779
You realize we're nothing
but sacks of meat and blood,

11:51.904 --> 11:54.699
and some bone to keep it all standing.

11:57.034 --> 11:59.078
Let me thank you ahead of time

11:59.203 --> 12:01.956
for guarding us all from the perils
beyond the Wall -
